{"title":"Vape Tanks","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eChoosing the right \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"vape\"\u003evape \u003c\/a\u003etank can make a world of difference. We've sorted the best vape tanks into the most popular categories to make it easy for you to choose the right one. You will find everything from sub ohm tanks, MTL tanks \u0026amp; rebuildable atomizers. Whichever style you prefer, you are sure to find something on this page. Just pair your tank of choice with your favorite vape mod, fill it up, and you are ready to vape!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"vaporesso-itank-m","title":"Vaporesso iTank M","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso iTank M is a compact 3ml vape tank is easy to maintain and uses coils that are push-fit, meaning there's less mess. The adjustable airflow allows you to set how tight or loose you want the inhale to feel. The 1.2 Ohm MTX coil that's included with the tank will create an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale with a discreet amount of vapour. The iTank M is compatible with any mod that use a 510 connection.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3ml Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Inhale\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Filling Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible With MTX Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePair With 50% Or Higher PG \u003ca title=\"E Liquids Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\"\u003eE-Liquids\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis tank is top filling, so you don't even have to take it off the mod to refill when it's empty, just push and twist the top cap to reveal the e-liquid inlet. The MTX 1.2 Ohm coil is best used between 8 - 12W, which creates an inhale that feels similar to a cigarette. As an MTL tank, the iTank M works well with e-liquids that are have a 50% PG concentration or a high PG blend.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso iTank M \u003ca title=\"Vape Tank\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-tanks\"\u003eVape Tank\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 Ohm Vaporesso MTX Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775207383095,"sku":"V iTank M","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-itank-m-box-min.jpg?v=1752511684"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-itank","title":"Vaporesso iTank Subohm Tank","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso iTank is an ideal option for anyone that's looking for increased vapour production and a genuine sub ohm vape. Thanks to being compatible with the whole range of Vaporesso GTi coils, this tank delivers a DTL (Direct To Lung) inhale. As well as the tank itself, you’ll also find a 0.2 Ohm and a 0.4 Ohm GTi mesh coil in the box, so you’re able to connect to your mod and vape right away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gti-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTi coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTi Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Sub Ohm Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Filling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible With High VG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-vape-coils\" title=\"Vape Coils\"\u003eVape Coils\u003c\/a\u003e Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its standard 510 connection, you can pair the iTank with most mods on the market. Beyond that, the range of compatible coils are all sub ohm, which means your tank is specifically designed to create a larger amount of vapour for DTL vaping. Plus, it features an adjustable airflow which allows you to set the feel of the inhale to be tighter or looser.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs it's a top filling vape tank, you don’t even have to detach it from your mod to refill. Simply unscrew the top cap to reveal the inlet and fill with up to 2ml of your chosen e-liquid. For best results with either of the included coils, we’d suggest that your e-liquid has a 70% VG concentration or higher. Also, when vaped, the mesh design of the coils produce an improved flavour due to heating up the e-liquid faster.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBox Contains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso 2ml iTank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2 Ohm Vaporesso GTi Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4 Ohm Vaporesso GTi Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 x O-Ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpare Glass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775213445175,"sku":"V iTank Subohm Tank","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-itank-min.jpg?v=1752512243"},{"product_id":"geekvape-baron-24mm-bf-rda","title":"GeekVape Baron 24mm BF RDA Tank","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Geek Vape BARON 24mm RDA is a performance dripper implementing a large expansive two-post build deck and multifunctional airflow system for a dynamic range of vapor production output unlike any other. The Geek Vape BARON hosts a dual post build deck, top secured via flathead screws arranged in a single or dual coil layout. Airflow for the BARON RDA is drawn through the slotted top cap, past the selected airflow option of the fixed inner cap and vents directly to the coil configuration through either a slotted or drilled 3x4 hole pattern.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the base of the Baron sits a stainless steel 510 connector that can accept a gold-plated BF squonk pin to allow for squonking of eJuice onto the coil configuration with the gentle pump from today's best squonk mods. In addition, the Baron is lightly knurled at the top cap to provide a better grip for those trying to adjust the airflow. Catering to cloud chasers, the BARON RDA comes with multiple drip tip options, such as a large PMMA widebore and a beautiful Resin widebore drip tip with the option of 510 drip tip adapter.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeek Vape BARON 24mm RDA Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e24mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeep Juice Wells\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Post Build Deck - Large Terminals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Secured via Flathead Screws\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePEEK Insulator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle or Dual Coil Configuration\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed Position Multifunctional Airflow Inner Cap - Various Airflow Designs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKnurled Top Cap for Easy Airflow Adjustment\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e810 Widebore Resin Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e810 Widebore PMMA Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Squonk BF Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDetachable Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Stainless Steel, Gunmetal, Black, Gold, Rainbow, Violet, Blue\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 BARON 24mm RDA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 PMMA Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 510 Drip Tip Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Feather Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Pre-Built Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Geek Vape Flathead Screwdriver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Hex Wrench\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Spare Parts Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Promotion Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Geekvape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215312951,"sku":"GeekV Baron 24mm BF RDA Tank","price":2100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/geek_vape_baron_24mm_bf_rda.jpg?v=1752512503"},{"product_id":"wismec-amor-mini-tank","title":"Wismec Amor Mini Tank","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Amor Mini tank features a top fill design and bottom airflow for optimal sub ohm . By rotating the airflow control valve of the atomizer base, one can easily adjust the airflow of the Amor. The more the slot is exposed, the larger the airflow. The Amor Mini has a 2ml tank capacity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pro-13\"\u003eStainless Steel Material \u0026amp; Detachable Structure : \u003c\/span\u003eAmor Mini is made of stainless steel, and appears to be high-grade. All the parts are easy to disassemble and clean.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pro-13\"\u003eTop E-liquid Filling : \u003c\/span\u003eBy unscrewing the top cap, you can complete the e-juice refilling quickly and easily.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pro-13\"\u003eBottom Airflow Control : \u003c\/span\u003eThrough the hidden the airflow control ring, you can adjust the air inlet quickly and get different vaping experiences.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1 * Amor Mini\u003cbr\u003e2 * Atomizer Head\u003cbr\u003e2 * Mouthpiece\u003cbr\u003e2 * Pin Screw\u003cbr\u003e1 * User Manual\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Wismec","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215509559,"sku":"Wismec Amor Mini Tank","price":1700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/wismec_amor_mini-min.jpg?v=1752512522"},{"product_id":"geekvape-ammit-22mm-mtl-rda-tank","title":"GeekVape Ammit 22mm MTL RDA Tank","description":"\u003cp\u003eBuy Geek Vape Ammit MTL RDA, which is the mouth-to-lung reincarnation of the popular Ammit RTA, featuring a horizontally-oriented single coil dual post build deck with a dynamic 3D Airflow System with 12 different airflow options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA precise 3D surround airflow combined with a dual layer chamber design allows intake air to be concentrated to the three outlets that are located directly beneath the coil, providing ample flavor delivery. Dotted along the top cap are the adjustable air holes, giving way to 12 airflow options between using the single or multiple air inlets. Centered in the middle is an optional BF squonker pin that accommodates on-the-go eJuice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA gold-plated 510 stainless steel connection pin ensures seamless connectivity while included is 2 separate drip tips for specific user preference in \u003ca title=\"Vape tank\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-tanks\"\u003evape tank\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeek Vape Ammit MTL RDA Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e22mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Spacious Juice Wells\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual-Layered Chamber Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo-Post, Single Terminal Build Deck\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Secured via Flathead Screws\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Coil Configuration\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecise 3D AirFlow Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12 Airflow Adjustment Options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop to Bottom Air Flow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Airflows go Direct-to-Coil for Max Flavor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mm Opening Stainless Steel Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mm Opening Delrin Sloped Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mm Opening Delrin Sloped Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Drip Tip Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSquonk-Ready Bottom-Feeding 510 Pin\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Ammit MTL RDA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.7ohm Prebuilt Clapton Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Stainless Steel MTL Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Delrin MTL Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Flathead Screwdriver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Allen Key\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Spare Parts Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Geekvape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41807824322615,"sku":"GeekV Ammit 22mm MTL RDA Tank","price":2100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/geek_vape_ammit_mtl_rda_leaning.webp?v=1754269045"},{"product_id":"ijoy-diamond-baby-tank","title":"iJoy Diamond Baby Tank","description":"\u003cp\u003eIJOY DIAMOND BABY Vape tank is a good flavor atomizer with RDA flavor. It produces large airflow, great vapor. Features 510 unique resin drip tip, stylish diamond design, a variety of processes and 180° fast screw-cap filling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with DM- MESH mesh coil and DM-DM diamond-like coil with uniform heating characteristics. Using Organic fiber Cotton, full of ejuice, soft and delicate taste, high degree of reduction, lasts longer!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Features\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDiameter: 22.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCapacity: 4ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColored Bubble tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Tank optional\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLarge airflow, great vapor, good flavor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDMB-MESH Mesh coil with uniform heating characteristics, Made by 70% Flax fiber + 30% Wood pulp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDMB-DM diamond-like coil with uniform heating characteristics, made by Organic fiber cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x DIAMOND BABY TANK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x DMB-Mesh Coil 0.18ohm (40-80W Pre-installed)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x DMB-DM Coil 0.15ohm (40-80W)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x Replacement Glass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x Tool pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iJOY","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41991009665079,"sku":"iJoy Diamond Baby Tank","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ijoy-diamond-baby-tank.webp?v=1763434689"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-tanks.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




